## Overview
[תיאור קצר של הפרויקט]

## Tech Stack
- Language: [e.g., TypeScript, Python]
- Framework: [e.g., Next.js, FastAPI]
- Database: [e.g., PostgreSQL, MongoDB]
- Key Dependencies: [list]

## Project Structure
```
src/
├── components/    # React components
├── pages/         # Next.js pages
